    "innovation": "By coupling ecological niche modeling and coalescent analyses, this paper demonstrates that the current genetic diversity of the Cerrado tree *Caryocar brasiliense* resulted from a range retraction into multiple refugia during the last glacial maximum, rather than from range stability or expansion.",
